{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cd1b014d-b15e-4dfa-8b30-3d1ad90b0b20",
    "name": "Part 3. Telegram Bot",
    "description": "Collection for Part 3: Telegram Bot API methods (at least 7 requests).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "bot_token",
      "value": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "chat_id",
      "value": "YOUR_CHAT_ID",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "YOUR_USER_ID",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "telegram_api_url",
      "value": "https://api.telegram.org",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. getMe",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/getMe",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "getMe"
          ]
        },
        "description": "4. Получи информацию о боте (метод getMe)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. getUpdates",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/getUpdates",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "getUpdates"
          ]
        },
        "description": "6. Ищи информацию о себе в ответе на метод getUpdates! Сохрани свой user_id и chat_id."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. sendMessage",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"chat_id\": \"{{chat_id}}\",\n  \"text\": \"Привет от телеграм-бота!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/sendMessage",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "sendMessage"
          ]
        },
        "description": "7. Отправь себе сообщение от имени бота (sendMessage)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. sendPhoto (Valid Photo)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "chat_id",
              "value": "{{chat_id}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "photo",
              "src": "sample.jpg",
              "type": "file",
              "description": "Attach sample.jpg here"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/sendPhoto",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "sendPhoto"
          ]
        },
        "description": "8. Отправить фотографию себе от имени бота (sendPhoto через form-data)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. sendPhoto (with PDF - Expected Error)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "chat_id",
              "value": "{{chat_id}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "photo",
              "src": "sample.pdf",
              "type": "file",
              "description": "Attach sample.pdf here to test Telegram response"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/sendPhoto",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "sendPhoto"
          ]
        },
        "description": "9. В методе sendPhoto вместо фотографии прикрепить pdf-документ (ожидается ошибка 400 Bad Request: PHOTO_INVALID_DIMENSIONS или IMAGE_PROCESS_FAILED)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. sendPhoto (with DOCX - Expected Error)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "chat_id",
              "value": "{{chat_id}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "photo",
              "src": "sample.docx",
              "type": "file",
              "description": "Attach sample.docx here to test Telegram response"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/sendPhoto",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "sendPhoto"
          ]
        },
        "description": "10. В методе sendPhoto вместо фотографии прикрепить docx-документ (ожидается ошибка 400 Bad Request)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. getUserProfilePhotos",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{telegram_api_url}}/bot{{bot_token}}/getUserProfilePhotos?user_id={{user_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{telegram_api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "bot{{bot_token}}",
            "getUserProfilePhotos"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "user_id",
              "value": "{{user_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "11. Посмотрим, что бот может узнать о тебе: getUserProfilePhotos."
      }
    }
  ]
}